window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In a twist of fate, the people who were outcasted from the society of Pura are the very ones who can save us all.</b></p> <p>Turns out that hybrids aren’t as rare as we thought...but will they come to the aid of a society who treats our kind like discarded trash? Do the pure bloods deserve to be saved?</p> <p>While finding the answers to those questions, secrets are revealed, and emotions flare. The bonds between mates are tested, and some unravel under the pressure. Alliances are forged, but at what cost?</p> <p>Author's Note: This audiobook has an 18+ warning and is intended for mature audiences. It is book two in the Monarchs of Hell series which will end in a cliff-hanger.</p>"; 
